			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100090101,
					"content": "嗯…根據之前的結果，調整一下實驗計畫吧。然後，得檢查器材和實驗用的素材…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090102,
					"content": "#對了，今天要做的煉金藥…咦，{NICKNAME}和派蒙，{F#妳}{M#你}們怎麼來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090103,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我們是來幫助妳完成「課題」的，想看看我們有什麼能幫得上忙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090104,
					"content": "「課題」…啊，妳是說阿貝多先生曾經提過的，和魔女會相關的「課題」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090105,
					"content": "真巧，今天正好有週期性實驗的安排。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090106,
					"content": "週期性？那豈不是說砂糖一直在做這個實驗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090107,
					"content": "是的，不過因為跟我研究的其他內容有方向性的一致，所以對於持續這個「課題」的實驗，並沒有太大的負擔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090108,
					"content": "不過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090109,
					"content": "怎麼了，是實驗遇到了什麼困難嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090110,
					"content": "嗯，實驗一直「沒能成功」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090111,
					"content": "啊，也就是說已經失敗了很多次了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090112,
					"content": "不能簡單地認為那是「失敗」，這個「課題」背後所蘊含的原理要比想像中複雜一些…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090113,
					"content": "所以到底是什麼課題呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100090114,
					"content": "對哦，說了半天，具體到底是要做什麼樣的實驗呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090115,
					"content": "能令甜甜花變成「十六倍大甜甜花」的藥劑配置的實驗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090116,
					"content": "也就是煉金藥劑「肆式植株倍化劑柒型」的配置。順便一提，之所以是「柒型」，是因為今天是第七次進行這個實驗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090117,
					"content": "十、十六倍大！總之，聽懂了，我們要做的就是「變大藥」第七版！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090118,
					"content": "「變大藥」第七版…是、是的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090119,
					"content": "不過雖然是第七版，但是配方並沒有做太多的調整，因為無論是原理還是實驗過程的產物都證明沒有問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090120,
					"content": "可是一直「沒能成功」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090121,
					"content": "嗯，所以我在想，是不是…需要別的要素介入。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090122,
					"content": "哼哼…很顯然，這個別的要素…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090123,
						100090125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090123,
					"content": "就讓我們來幫忙實驗吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100090124,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我們本來就是來看看能幫上什麼忙的嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090127,
					"content": "加入派蒙的話，原本的材料配比就得做出調整，效果說不定不如之前已經穩定的配方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090128,
					"content": "我才不要變成材料，快把正常的配方拿出來啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090129,
					"content": "就在這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090130,
					"content": "不過，還缺少兩個材料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090131,
					"content": "嘿嘿，那就包在我們身上了，是什麼啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090132,
					"content": "作為配置底料的清泉鎮的泉水，還有有點麻煩的是，狂風之核的碎片。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "砂糖"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090133,
					"content": "好，我們這就出發吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 100090125,
					"content": "就讓派蒙以身入藥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100090126,
					"content": "那肯定能做出了不起的煉金藥劑…才不對！什麼叫讓我入藥啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100090127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
